                "field_constraint_data": "Rheumatology|Neurology|Pain medicine|Sleep Medicine|ENT|OMFS|Immunologist|Opthamologist|Orthopedics|Infectious diesease|Genetics|Functional Medicine|Psychiatrist|Gastroenterologist|Dermatology|Cardiology|General Dentist|Orthodontics|Periodontist|Prosthodotist|Endodontist"
